irement, external claim flow, survey, credential request or gift-card code generator.", "evidence": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "observation": "The description states that a $50 iTunes giveaway is conditioned on reaching 10,000 subscribers.", "source_id": "DESCRIPTION_0001", "quote": "I will be doing a $50 dollar ITunes giveaway when we reach 10,000 subscribers."}, {"evidence_id": "E002", "observation": "The speaker asks viewers to share the channel and like and subscribe to the video.", "source_id": "ASR_0001", "quote": "so make sure to share the channel with your friends and like and subscribe to this video"}, {"evidence_id": "E003", "observation": "A gift-card image visibly displays \"$50\" and iTunes branding.", "source_id": "F0012", "quote": ""}, {"evidence_id": "E004", "observation": "The frame visibly shows prompts reading \"Subscribe\" and \"Like\".", "source_id": "F0047", "quote": ""}]}}
